\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  1.\cf0  Create within me a clean heart
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  O Lord, my heart is vile!
\par  It's nature has quite destroyed me,
\par  Within me I feel distressed
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  My sins committed in the past,
\par  Give me much pain, I feel regrets,
\par  Create in me a new heart.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Recreate your spirit within me
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  To make my thinking righteous
\par  And make me surrender to Thee,
\par  Thy wishes only to please,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  May I all carnal needs detest,
\par And inherit hereby from faith
\par  Great love and hope eternal.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  I'm just fit to be thrown away
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Because it fully serves me right.
\par But, pity me, my great lover,
\par Kindle your eyes unto me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus, intercede Thou for me,
\par And leave me not in sin entrenched.
\par May I always be with you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Grant that Your Spirit of calmness
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Controls and strengthens my life.
\par That the Devil and even death
\par May fail to make me frightened
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord it is only in You
\par That my hope is ever assured,
\par Of having peace eternal.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

